"-Adressen, sobald der HTTPS-Only-Modus aktiv ist — die Verbindung scheiterte dann, bevor sie zustande kam. Außerdem gibt iOS die": ", as soon as HTTPS-Only mode is active — the connection then failed before it was even established. In addition, iOS allows",
