"malariafrei; Puffotter/Kap-Kobra/Boomslang; Zecken (Zeckenbissfieber); Grosswild v. a. in umzaeunten Reservaten": "malaria-free; puff adder/Cape cobra/Boomslang; ticks (tick bite fever); big game mainly in fenced reserves",
